# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.html
coverage.txt
coverage.xml
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Built binaries
/bin/

# Web (vite): build output is embedded into the binary; the placeholder
# dist/index.html is committed so a plain `go build` works before `make web`.
node_modules/
web/dist/*
!web/dist/index.html

# Cypress run artifacts
web/cypress/videos/
web/cypress/screenshots/
web/cypress/downloads/

# Generated SSH host-key state (per-playbook scope files)
strangle.*.known_hosts
strangle.*.auto.json
strangle.*.pending.json
known_hosts.strangle
known_hosts.accepted.json
known_hosts.auto.json
hostkeys.pending.json

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
